COMMENT     REVIEWED REFSEQ: This record has been curated by NCBI staff. The
            reference sequence was derived from J02151.
            [1] compared this sequence with that for p2 and p3 (see separate
            entries), but found no significant homology between any two of the
            three sequences. p1 cds determined by consideration of open reading
            frames and the mw and net charge of the p1 protein. this sequence
            completes the A/Puerto Rico/8/34 genome; see separate entries for
            other segments.
